---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<SiteLayout title="Changelog — Backupist" description="Backupist release notes and changelog." active="changelog">
  <section class="wrap page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">What's new</span><h1>Changelog.</h1><p>Release notes for Backupist and its previous name, Easy Backup Manager. Entries are being migrated to the new product site.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap content"><div class="note"><b>Release number and publication date are being confirmed.</b> The notes below summarize changes planned for the current release; they will be updated with the official version details and links.</div>
    <article class="release"><div class="release-date">CURRENT RELEASE<br />Version/date pending</div><div><h2>Compatibility and maintenance</h2><ul><li>Updated the Windows package to use restic 0.19.1 instead of the earlier 0.18.x line.</li><li>Updated the application build for Qt 6.12.0 LTS.</li><li>Included minor bug fixes and compatibility updates.</li></ul></div></article>
    <article class="release"><div class="release-date">PREVIOUS RELEASES<br />Archive pending</div><div><h2>Earlier Easy Backup Manager releases</h2><p>Older EBM release notes will be added here as the project history is transferred. Backupist is the new name for Easy Backup Manager; the project continues as a free desktop application.</p></div></article>
    <p class="legal">Release version numbers, dates, and detailed notes will be added after confirmation against the published release artifacts.</p><a class="button line" href={`${base}downloads/`}>Go to downloads ↗</a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
